    "breadcrumb": "Поддршка Swing Catalyst \u003e Почетак",
    "content": "Како сазнам која верзија Swing Catalyst или Motion Catalyst имам? Swing Catalyst 9.7 и новије Верзија је наведена у доњем десном углу\nSwing Catalyst 9.5 \u0026 older Go to the main menu and select Settings -\u003e General.\nClick Show license configuration\nVersion is highlighted in red:\nChecking through Windows Settings Don’t have a valid support \u0026 update plan? Note: If you have a software subscription this does not apply to you, support \u0026 update is included in the subscription.\nPurchase a support \u0026 update plan and get access to the newest software today: https://shop.swingcatalyst.com/products/support-update-plan\nLast updated: 2023-10-24 | View on official support site",
