    "breadcrumb": "Поддршка Swing Catalyst \u003e Софтвер и функције",
    "content": "Овај чланак показује како извезти снимке из Swing Catalyst / Motion Catalyst.\nКако извезти снимке Снимци се могу извезти на неколико начина, било из Stack-а или из самог Explorer-а. Функционално нема разлике између њих.\nИзвоз из stack-а Exporting from the Explorer Recordings can be exported from the explorer by dragging a recording to the export list (see below screenshot) or by right clicking the recording and selecting from the available export options.\nThe Explorer Export list Export options Exporting as a take file (the default option) will allow the recording to be imported by other Swing Catalyst or Motion Catalyst users. All of the data collected with the recording is stored with the take file.\nIf you wish to export just the video file(s) select “Video only”. Note if you have multiple cameras this will export each angle as a separate video file.\nFor details on the raw data option please see our raw data article.\nLast updated: 2023-12-19 | View on official support site",
    "description": "Снимци се могу извезти на неколико начина, било из Stack-а или из самог Explorer-а. Функционално нема разлике између њих.",
